 Rust developer's day. Image decoding, regex and crypto\nstop being 20× slower than release while your own code stays quick to rebuild.</p>\n<h2 id=\"share-a-dependency-version-across-a-workspace\">Share a dependency version across a workspace</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># root Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">workspace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">members = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"crates/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">resolver = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"2\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">workspace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">dependencies</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">serde = { version = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, features = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\