>Without <code>rerun-if-changed</code>, cargo re-runs the script on every file change in the\npackage — the usual cause of \"why is my build script running constantly\".</p>\n<h2 id=\"cross-compile-a-static-linux-binary\">Cross-compile a static Linux binary</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> rustup</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> add</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> build</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --release</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-musl</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> file</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> target/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/release/myapp</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># statically linked — runs on any Linux, including scratch containers</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>For glibc targets, <code>cargo-zigbuild</code> pins the glibc version:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> zigbuild</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.2.17</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --release</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"cache-compilation-across-branches\">Cache compilation across branches</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> install</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> sccache</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> RUSTC_WRAPPER=sccache</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>sccache keys on the compiler flags and source hash, so switching branches and back\nreuses artifacts. On CI it turns a 6-minute build into 40 seconds after the first\nrun.</p>\n<h2 id=\"link-faster\">Link faster</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># .cargo/config.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">linker = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"clang\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">rustflags = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"-C\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"link-arg=-fuse-ld=mold\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Linking is 30–50% of a full build. <code>mold</code> is the fastest linker available on Linux.</p>\n<h2 id=\"find-out-where-the-time-goes\">Find out where the time goes</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> build</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --timings</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># opens target/cargo-timings/cargo-timing.html</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>The Gantt chart names the crate responsible. It is almost always <code>syn</code>, <code>regex</code>,\n<code>image</code>, or something you could enable fewer features on.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ci-that-fails-on-the-things-that-matter\">CI that fails on the things that matter</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"yaml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"yaml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">- </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">cargo fmt --all -- --check</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">- </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">- </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">cargo nextest run --workspace</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">- </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">cargo test --doc --workspace</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">- </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">cargo audit</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">- </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8DDB8C\">run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">cargo deny check</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><code>--locked</code> on any build in CI: it fails if <code>Cargo.lock</code> would change, which is the\nalert you want when a dependency silently moves.</p>\n<h2 id=\"reproducible-toolchains\">Reproducible toolchains</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># rust-toolchain.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">toolchain</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">channel = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"1.85.0\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">components = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"rustfmt\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"clippy\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">targets = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Six lines that make every machine — laptop, CI, container — compile with the same\ncompiler. The highest-value file in a Rust repo.</p>\n<h2 id=\"trim-the-release-binary\">Trim the release binary</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">profile</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">release</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">lto = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"thin\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">codegen-units = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">panic = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"abort\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">strip = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"symbols\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> build</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --release</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> ls</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -lh</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> target/release/myapp</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">      # often 40-60% smaller</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><code>panic = \"abort\"</code> removes unwinding tables. Do not use it if you rely on\n<code>catch_unwind</code> (some web frameworks do, to isolate handler panics).</p>\n<h2 id=\"vendored-builds-for-air-gapped-ci\">Vendored builds for air-gapped CI</h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">$</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> cargo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> vendor</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> vendor/</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"toml\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\"># .cargo/config.toml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">source</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">crates-io</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">replace-with = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"vendored-sources\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">source</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">vendored-sources</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">directory = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"vendor\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Now <code>cargo build --offline</code> works with no network at all.</p>\n<p><strong>Back to:</strong> <a href=\"../README.md\">Examples index</a></p>"}